<title>USA: Tesoro realigns senior management.</title>
<headline>Tesoro realigns senior management.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tesoro Petroleum Corp said Tuesday it has realigned senior management with William T. Van Kleef, formerly senior vice president and chief financial officer, assuming the new position of executive vice president, operations and development.</p>
<p>The company said its exploration and production, refining and marketing, and marine services operations will report to him, as will all business development activities.</p>
<p>Tesoro said James C. Reed Jr, executive vice president, general counsel and secretary, has assumed the additional responsibilities of finance, accounting and tax.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
